/// Where a Guard case came from (§5.12).
///
/// Stored rather than derived. After the fact the only clues are the category and the first
/// message, and both are written by whoever opened it — so a case raised by staff off a report
/// reads exactly like one a member started. Staff triage differently depending on which it is: a
/// member asking for help is a conversation, and a case opened off a scan is an intervention
/// nobody asked for.
enum GuardCaseSource {
  /// The member opened it themselves (§6.3.1).
  MEMBER
  /// A content scan raised it (§6.5).
  AUTO_CONTENT
  /// A message scan raised it (§6.8.1).
  AUTO_MESSAGE
  /// Staff escalated a report case to Guard.
  REPORT
  /// Staff escalated something else — a queue item, or an escalation record.
  ESCALATION
}

